=head1 DESCRIPTION

Options to configure a custom endpoint for an OpenSearch Service
domain.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 CustomEndpoint => Str

The fully qualified URL for the custom endpoint.


=head2 CustomEndpointCertificateArn => Str

The ARN for your security certificate, managed in Amazon Web Services
Certificate Manager (ACM).


=head2 CustomEndpointEnabled => Bool

Whether to enable a custom endpoint for the domain.


=head2 EnforceHTTPS => Bool

True to require that all traffic to the domain arrive over HTTPS.


=head2 TLSSecurityPolicy => Str

Specify the TLS security policy to apply to the HTTPS endpoint of the
domain. The policy can be one of the following values:

=over

=item *

B<Policy-Min-TLS-1-0-2019-07:> TLS security policy that supports TLS
version 1.0 to TLS version 1.2

=item *

B<Policy-Min-TLS-1-2-2019-07:> TLS security policy that supports only
TLS version 1.2

=item *

B<Policy-Min-TLS-1-2-PFS-2023-10:> TLS security policy that supports
TLS version 1.2 to TLS version 1.3 with perfect forward secrecy cipher
suites

=back




